                <mxCell id="m30" value="Each number counts hand-written .dart files declaring at least one &lt;i&gt;import 'package:flutter_clean_arch_riverpod/&amp;lt;layer&amp;gt;/…'&lt;/i&gt; — .g.dart, .freezed.dart, .gr.dart and .config.dart are left out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#9199a4&quot;&gt;Measured on 26/09/2026. To check one edge: &lt;i&gt;grep -rl &quot;import 'package:flutter_clean_arch_riverpod/domain/&quot; lib/presentation --include='*.dart' | wc -l&lt;/i&gt; — or just run &lt;i&gt;make flutter-test-arch&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
