                <mxCell id="q_n" value="Every hop returns &lt;i&gt;Either&amp;lt;Failure, T&amp;gt;&lt;/i&gt;. The DTO dies at the repository — what leaves it is an entity — and the notifier folds the Either into &lt;i&gt;success&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;failure&lt;/i&gt;, which is the whole of the error handling in the screen." style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#6b7280;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="65" y="188" width="1060" height="18" as="geometry" />
                </mxCell>
